menu "Bench agent"

    config BENCH_HOST_TIMEOUT_MS
        int "Host timeout (ms)"
        range 500 60000
        default 2000
        help
            When the host sends no message for this time, the agent sets every
            output pin to its initial value and sends a watchdog event. The host
            sends a ping every 500 ms.

    config BENCH_READ_POLL_MS
        int "Serial read poll time (ms)"
        range 1 50
        default 5
        help
            The longest time that the main loop waits for host input before it
            checks the report timer and the watchdog.

endmenu
